ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Na is a city planner, she proposes a plan to rebuild the old park at the community meeting. However, this proposal encounters strong opposition from some community residents.\n\n[Question]\nLi Na should feel angry at the opponents, but she feels moved, why?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Li Na's proposal receives approval and financial support from the city government, this makes her feel very moved.\nB. Li Na finds that the opponents are actually considering the interests of the community, this sense of responsibility moves her.\nC. Despite the opposition, there are also many community residents who express support for her proposal, and give her great respect and gratitude.\nD. Li Na is moved by the sincerity and enthusiasm of the opponents, this inspires her deeper love for the community.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002472546637879987,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e37ed6006945d2805542","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368382316,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:39:42","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"beab849aeb864908b1b25a16b541736e"}